    "body": "\n    <p><strong>Status: DISCONTINUED as of May 1, 2026.</strong> The Basket Financing product and its associated\n    reward are no longer active. The description below is retained for historical/reference purposes only —\n    do not offer Basket Financing to customers.</p>\n    <p><em>What it was:</em> Basket Financing allowed a customer to combine multiple eligible small items into a\n    single loan application (e.g. \"10 floor mats, 1 mop, 5 plates\") using the \"Basket of Goods\" commodity option.\n    Pricing followed the Starter segment: Min DP 10%, Min FA ₱2,000, Max FA ₱15,000, Add-on rate 6.00%, term 3–10 months.</p>\n  "
